### Login API Endpoint Test
### Test JWT-based authentication

### Register as Etudiant
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newstudent",
  "password": "password123",
  "userType": "ETUDIANT",
  "matricule": "ETU2026001",
  "nom": "Dupont",
  "prenom": "Jean",
  "email": "jean.dupont@example.com"
}

###

### Register as Formateur
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newteacher",
  "password": "password123",
  "userType": "FORMATEUR",
  "nom": "Martin",
  "prenom": "Marie",
  "email": "marie.martin@example.com",
  "specialiteId": 1
}

###

### Login as Admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

